### Login para obter token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "qwe",
    "password": "qwe"
}

###
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### GetAllPiquete
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPiquete HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GetPiqueteByID
GET http://localhost:40000/getPiqueteByID/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### InsertPiquete
POST http://localhost:40000/insertPiquete HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Piquete C1",
    "latitude": -20.426000,
    "longitude": -49.976000,
    "pastoidfk": 1,
    "removido": false
}

### UpdatePiquete
PUT http://localhost:40000/updatePiquete/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Piquete A1 Atualizado",
    "latitude": -20.422550,
    "longitude": -49.972850,
    "pastoidfk": 1,
    "removido": false
}

### DeletePiquete
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deletePiquete/3 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}